  "text": "proprium.dominica-ii-post-pascha-introitus",
  "about": "The introitus of the formulary “Second Sunday after Easter” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "The earth is full of the mercy of the Lord, alleluia; by the word of the Lord the heavens were established, alleluia, alleluia. Rejoice in the Lord, O ye just; praise becometh the upright. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Ghost. As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever shall be, world without end. Amen. The earth is full of the mercy of the Lord, alleluia; by the word of the Lord the heavens were established, alleluia, alleluia." }
